<title>FRANCE: Thomson-CSF 9-month sales rise slightly.</title>
<headline>Thomson-CSF 9-month sales rise slightly.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months to Sept 30, 1996.</p>
<p>(All figures in millions of French francs)</p>
<p>    Turnover					23,692    vs   23,151</p>
<p>    - of which third quarter		   7,255    vs    7,633</p>
<p>NOTE - Defence group Thomson-CSF gave the figures in the BALO official bulletin.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
